### Obtain a JWT token through Traefik
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/token
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "admin",
  "password": "admin123"
}

### List users
GET http://localhost:8080/api/users

### Create a new user
POST http://localhost:8080/api/users
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "charlie",
  "password": "charlie123",
  "email": "charlie@example.com",
  "role": "CLIENT"
}

### Create a device
POST http://localhost:8080/api/devices
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Inverter",
  "type": "INVERTER",
  "status": "ACTIVE",
  "maxConsumption": 3.7,
  "userId": 1
}

### Fetch all devices
GET http://localhost:8080/api/devices

### Fetch devices by user
GET http://localhost:8080/api/devices?userId=1

### Fetch monitoring aggregates for all devices
GET http://localhost:8080/api/monitoring/consumption

### Fetch monitoring aggregates for a device
GET http://localhost:8080/api/monitoring/consumption/device/1

### Swagger UI (Authorization service)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/auth/swagger-ui/index.html

### Swagger UI (Monitoring service)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/monitoring/swagger-ui/index.html

### OpenAPI JSON (Device service)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/devices/v3/api-docs
